navigation2: build with this tree's xtensor 0.27 and Ceres

- nav2_mppi_controller includes xtensor's headers by their pre-0.26 paths
  (xtensor/xtensor.hpp, xview.hpp, xmath.hpp, ...). xtensor 0.26 moved them
  into subdirectories (containers/, views/, core/, generators/, io/, misc/,
  reducers/); the xtensor component is 0.27.1: "xtensor/xtensor.hpp: No such
  file or directory". Include them by their current paths (xtensor's
  target also asks for C++20, which these sources build with).
- nav2_constrained_smoother asks for Ceres with its SuiteSparse component;
  the ceres-solver component is built without SuiteSparse ("Missing
  requested Ceres components: [SuiteSparse]"), with Eigen's sparse
  Cholesky, which serves the smoother's default SPARSE_NORMAL_CHOLESKY
  solver. Require Ceres only.
- nav2_mppi_controller's AckermannMotionModel assigns to an
  xt::masked_view; with xtensor 0.27 and xtl 0.8 that assignment is
  ambiguous (xtl::xmasked_value<float&> has two candidate operator=). Do the
  same element by element.

Upstream-Status: Pending
